2b:Tbf0,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.raulji.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Gujarat","item":"https://www.raulji.com/gujarat/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Gandhinagar","item":"https://www.raulji.com/gandhinagar/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"Private Limited","item":"https://www.raulji.com/gandhinagar/private-limited-company-registration/"}]},{"@type":"Service","@id":"https://www.raulji.com/gandhinagar/private-limited-company-registration/#service","name":"Private Limited Company Registration in Gandhinagar","description":"Gandhinagar's registration profile is shaped by two very different forces, and which one applies to you changes the advice completely.","url":"https://www.raulji.com/gandhinagar/private-limited-company-registration/","serviceType":"Private Limited Company Registration","provider":{"@id":"https://www.raulji.com/#organization"},"areaServed":{"@type":"City","name":"Gandhinagar","containedInPlace":{"@type":"AdministrativeArea","name":"Gandhinagar district, Gujarat"}},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"INR","price":"9999","description":"One-time professional fee. Government filing fees and stamp duty are charged separately and vary by state and authorised capital.","url":"https://www.raulji.com/gandhinagar/private-limited-company-registration/"}},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Do Gujarat government tenders require a Private Limited Company?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It depends on the tender, and this is worth checking rather than assuming. Many permit either a company or an LLP. Many also require audited accounts and a minimum turnover for a stated number of past financial years, which no newly incorporated entity can provide. Read the eligibility clause of the specific tender before spending money on a structure."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I incorporate a company for GIFT City through a normal registration?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Incorporation is the ordinary MCA process, but it is only part of what operating inside the IFSC requires. IFSC activities need authorisation under the IFSC regime administered by the IFSCA, and those requirements affect how the entity should be structured and capitalised. The structure needs to be planned around the authorisation from the start, and the IFSC side generally needs specialist advice beyond incorporation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is a company or an LLP better for Gandhinagar government consultancy work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Usually whichever the tenders you intend to bid for permit, and often they permit both. Where both are allowed, an LLP costs materially less to run each year, since it avoids statutory audit below the thresholds. Where you expect to bid repeatedly and the tenders want audited accounts, the company's audit obligation from year one stops being a drawback."}}]}]}21:[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2b"}}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Breadcrumb","className":"container-wide pt-28 md:pt-32","children":["$","ol",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":["$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f"]}]}],"$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37"]
