32:["$","section",null,{"id":"$undefined","className":"section-padding","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-12 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary","children":"Local considerations"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] lg:leading-tight","children":"What is worth checking in Gandhinagar"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"These are the points that actually differ by market, rather than the general features of the structure."}]]}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-border md:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","li","Read the tender eligibility clause before you incorporate",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"01"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Read the tender eligibility clause before you incorporate"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"This is the single most useful thing a Gandhinagar contractor can do. Tender documents commonly specify the permitted entity type, and frequently require audited accounts and turnover for a number of past financial years. A company incorporated this month has none of those. Incorporating in the hope of qualifying, without reading the clause, is how people spend money and still fail eligibility."}]]}],["$","li","GIFT City authorisation is separate from incorporation",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"02"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"GIFT City authorisation is separate from incorporation"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Operating inside the IFSC at GIFT City requires authorisation under the IFSC regime, administered by the IFSCA, in addition to being incorporated. The requirements depend on the activity, and they affect how the entity should be structured, capitalised and located. Plan the incorporation around the authorisation, not the other way round, and expect to need specialist advice on the IFSC side."}]]}],["$","li","Audit from year one, which tenders may want anyway",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"03"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Audit from year one, which tenders may want anyway"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"A Private Limited Company requires statutory audit from its first financial year whatever the turnover, plus annual ROC filings. For a Gandhinagar firm bidding for government work this is less of a burden than elsewhere, because audited accounts are often exactly what the tender asks for. Maintaining them properly from the start is worth doing for that reason alone."}]]}],["$","li","Two directors, and an address that documents cleanly",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"04"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Two directors, and an address that documents cleanly"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"You need at least two directors and two shareholders, with one director resident in India for 182 days or more in the previous calendar year. A registered office in one of the sector commercial blocks, Infocity, Kudasan or Sargasan is fine, provided the address proof matches: a recent utility bill and a no-objection certificate from the owner."}]]}]]}]]}]}]
